Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:37:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 020/139] feat(look): epic grade LUT fitted to S1 and a rim
 light on Brennic

apps/vr/tools/look/fit_grade_lut.py (BP's fitter, target S1) fitted the curve model at 0.8 on
nine matched regions of the epic S1 frame (s1-grade-regions.json): it pulls the orange excess
out of sand, stone and crowd and lifts the blues; T_EpicGradeLUT is imported with the surfaces
and applied as the epic post volume's colour-grading LUT (-MageArenaEpicNoLut turns it off).
A warm back light follows Brennic on its own lighting channel, shared only with him, so it
rims him at 16 m without lighting the sand or the wall.

