+A single horizontal row of ten separate full-body spectators of a Roman-era arena, each seated on an invisible bench (seen from the front, knees bent, sitting), leaning forward excitedly, some with one arm raised or clapping, each figure apart with clear empty space between them, no figure touching or overlapping another, all at the same scale, the whole figure visible. Stylised painterly 3D game art like a warm animated film: men and women of varied ages and skin tones in simple tunics and cloaks in warm reds, wine, ochre, cream, deep blue, brown and plum. Even soft warm golden-hour light from the front left, gentle shading. Background: one perfectly flat uniform pure chroma-key green (#00B140) everywhere, no bench visible, no floor, no shadow, no gradient, no scenery. No green, teal or turquoise clothing. No text, no labels, no watermark.
