+A single horizontal row of ten separate full-body spectators of a Roman-era arena, standing and cheering, each figure standing apart with clear empty space between them, no figure touching or overlapping another, all at the same scale, feet on the same baseline, the whole figure from head to feet visible. Stylised painterly 3D game art like a warm animated film: men and women of varied ages and skin tones in simple tunics and cloaks in warm reds, wine, ochre, cream, deep blue, brown and plum, a few with raised arms, fists in the air, waving, clapping, mouths open shouting. Even soft warm golden-hour light from the front left, gentle shading. Background: one perfectly flat uniform pure chroma-key green (#00B140) everywhere, no floor, no shadow, no gradient, no scenery. No green, teal or turquoise clothing. No text, no labels, no watermark.
