 exposure down a notch

Under the epic look: an additive white-gold heart card (M_EpicFireHeart, HDR, pulsing) on
every warm bolt core, gated to Fire's hue (never steel, the cool elements or the leave
class's black core), so bloom turns the glossy orb into a blazing heart; Tier A's ward cards
take M_EpicWard (their wave on T_Q_WardWave plus refraction, a depth fade into the sand and
less cover). Spell and heart colours are read by parameter name, comparing RGB only (the
alpha made every glow read black before). Exposure -0.2 EV and the sky dome gain 1.3, after
the blind judges called the golden sky and wall overexposed.

