+ * cuff). Same place, same masks, same bars and their meaning (HP magenta, mana blue, stamina green, clock gold): the
+ * panel draws through M_CuffStyled (a bronze frame round the edge, the mask's icons softened and warmed, less opaque),
+ * and each bar is a slim glowing rune strip (M_CuffRune) in a softer, desaturated version of its own hue.
+ * Tools/CreateCuffStyledCommandlet builds both in /Game/Look/Shared/Cuff.
+ */
+namespace CuffLook
+{
+FString Folder();
+
+/** The panel's base material under a non-flat look (its texture parameters take the masks as before), or null. */
+UMaterialInterface* PanelBase();
+
+/** Under a non-flat look, gives Bar the rune strip in a softened Colour. Nothing under flat or without the asset. */
+void StyleBar(UStaticMeshComponent* Bar, const FLinearColor& Colour, UObject& Outer);
+
+/** The softened hue a styled bar shows: 40 % toward its own luminance, a little dimmer. Exposed for tests. */
+FLinearColor Soften(const FLinearColor& Colour);
+}
