From 30c3418b7d5cde191176428e21f3cd41bd6b0dc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:14:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 041/139] feat(look): Brennic's cast reads at 16 m, hand fire
 and glow, ward spray up close

Shared by the quest and epic looks (flat unchanged). His cast fire is half
again as big, with a halo round each hand (two points of fire at 16 m) and a
warm pool of glow on the sand at his feet. An enemy bolt within 1.7 m of the
eye with the ward up throws the ward's droplets on its eye side (no crown:
spray in the player's colour over a bolt farther out made a Fire bolt read as
Water).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
