From 637dc21c3fd2375cedc20fd451344f33a71e53c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:56:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 061/139] fix(look): S1's fire pylons under the epic look too

Blind round 2 marked epic r6 down for its pillar tops: only the floor braziers burned. The
quest look's four stone pylons with bowl fires (on the first tread, either side of the view)
move out of QuestLook::BuildDressing into QuestLook::BuildPylons, which quest calls as before
(floor-brazier fire cards included) and the epic look now calls too, without the floor cards
(epic burns its own), giving each pylon fire a flickering light.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../Game/Source/MageArenaVR/Look/EpicLook.cpp |  16 +++
 .../Source/MageArenaVR/Look/QuestLook.cpp     | 101 ++++++++++--------
 .../Game/Source/MageArenaVR/Look/QuestLook.h  |   6 ++
 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

