+// the stands' top from the seat) and its top at High. Judge round 2: with the warm still the upper frame shows its golden clouds (Low 12.7, High 30 degrees; lifting it 5 to 11 degrees
+// left only a flat orange band in the game camera) so the
+// warm glow band, not the cool upper sky, fills the frame above the stands, as in S1 and the epic look.
 const TCHAR* SkyUvCode = TEXT(
     "float3 d = -V;\n"
     "float t = atan2(d.y, d.x) / 3.14159265;\n"
