From a0ddd93de419f5912d8032a933443fbf814b1c31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:09:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 070/139] feat(look): -MageArenaStyle=painted|chalk art style
 axis, painted fallback per asset class

Look/ArenaStyle: orthogonal to -MageArenaLook, parsed once, painted by
default (every push capture keeps its meaning), flat ignores it. Quest and
spell assets resolve to <look folder>/Chalk under chalk and fall back to the
painted asset with one MAGEVR_STYLE log line per asset class. The T16
style-pick readers of the same flag (ArenaLayout, ElementColour,
PresentationLook) treat painted/chalk as no T16 style. Test
MageArena.Look.StyleParse.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
