From a557e9b141fcb95609e567bc2346989407fe9244 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:09:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 071/139] docs(look): style manifests for painted and chalk,
 schema README

apps/vr/art/style/<id>/style.json: asset folders, STYLE BLOCK, opposites,
suffixes per slot kind, palette, slots (kind, aspect, subject, asset; the
painted set records the prompts actually used), material parameters, grade.
Chalk is built from RETARGET-CHALK-SLATE sections 2-3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
