Subject: [PATCH 072/139] feat(look): studio-still composes prompts from a
 style manifest, --dry

gen --style <id> --slot <slot> (or --subject-file and --kind) builds STYLE
BLOCK + slot subject + kind suffix + opposites from
apps/vr/art/style/<id>/style.json, takes the slot's aspect, logs style and
slot in studio-log.jsonl; --dry prints the composed prompt and spends nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
