From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:37:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 076/139] feat(look): chalk probe 2, slate polarity, chalk
 edges, rune circles, hull outlines

Under -MageArenaStyle=chalk only. M_Q_ChalkSurface v2: bare slate base, light
drawn by adding chalk (the still's bright marks, laid densely on sunlit faces
and sparsely in shade), colour only where ColourAllowed (the sand), broken
white chalk lines along every box face's edges (mesh UV, fwidth-wide, no
screen pass), the stands eroding into slate above 5.5 m. Stone and flagstone
re-prompted as white line work on slate. M_Q_ChalkRune: procedural rune
circles round and in front of the seats; in the S30 shot only, a red
telegraph ring before the mage and a blue water sigil at the right
fingertip. M_Q_ChalkOutline: inverted hull (back faces, pushed along the
normal) following Brennic and the hands. Crowd as grey chalk sketches (an
instance of M_CrowdPainted on a derived chalk atlas). Slate-black sky.

