From b9782f64c3b3ac2ab6b1cba1b6543d6c725234a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:51:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 077/139] feat(look): chalk probe 3, drawn backdrop, chalk
 figures, cuff, stroke fire, ward arc

Under -MageArenaStyle=chalk only (owner redirect 10-28). The arena round the
sand is one chalk-drawn panorama (studio slot backdrop) mapped on the sky
dome by view direction (the seat never moves); the 3D wall, stands, coping,
crowd, pylons, banners and fire props are hidden (wardstones and spawn posts
stay). Brennic and the hands draw in chalk (M_Q_Brennic, M_Q_Hands in the
chalk folder): flat N.L value steps, pastel saturation, hatching in shade and
creases, a pale rim, a broken varying-width contour. The hull outline is off
by default (-MageArenaChalkOutline). A slate shadow pool under Brennic, a
bronze cuff with four coloured runes on the left wrist. The warm bolt core is
layered chalk strokes (no white heart card); the ward pans a continuous
chalk wave band. Sand re-prompted as smooth pale ochre pastel. D-G4 p95 118.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
