From 21aa2a5b1ac30f4273ee933f659b8b61a8fdfd29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:19:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 079/139] fix(look): chalk probe 5, recorded pointing hand,
 wrists and cuff in frame

Chalk style and the S30 shot only. The right hand's pointing pose is the
recorded sigil-line2 stroke on the action player (index out, the other
fingers curled, sampled from the clip), started 1.2 s before the still; the
synthetic finger fold (which smeared over the knuckles) is gone. Shot-only
hand offsets and a -20 degree look put both wrists, the dark sleeves and the
bronze cuff in frame. The spawn marker posts (greybox layout markers) hide
under chalk with the props. The wardstone chalk instance draws its faces
lighter; the wardstones log their material (chalk MI_Q_Pylon).

