From b7dfff777a09aff6c47bf6b3bab64193c0d634d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:18:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 082/139] feat(look): chalk round p7, ward arch back, calm
 pastel sand, guides, shared grain

Chalk style only. Ward: back to the arch ribbon round the palm (the p4/p5
placement, upright cards, shader lift), leaning a fifth to the left, the
chalk wave band with the shared grain broken along its strokes. Sand: a new
calm still of short varied pastel strokes, tiled at 2.4 m, pale, with faint
construction guides (every 7 m and 5 m, pixel-width lines) on the sand and
the dais. Wardstones mid-value chalk (7x, span 0.1). The warm core's heart is
smaller. The glow cards take the same per-cell chalk grain. Rebuilt with Tier
B's chalk Brennic (49ec3c1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
