From 692d2fd8908a6667ecfa3d48c4c60569afb4304e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:35:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 086/139] feat(art): irregular drawn finger creases and
 chalk-red runes on the cuff

The finger creases wander along the finger, thin and break, and cover only part of its girth
(a drawn mark, not a ring). The cuff's lit runes use the style's chalk colours as linear
values (#F06A4D red, #7CC4E8 blue, a chalk green, #F2D06B yellow), so the red no longer reads
pink on the mobile proxy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
