From 72ddf5d89ca25653a60142e3481f3a274fd0a3df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:57:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 087/139] feat(look): chalk round p8, p5 ward and ring back,
 bolt from his hand, drawn guides

Under -MageArenaStyle=chalk only (flat and painted unchanged); the S30 shot staging is shot-only.
- Ward: the p5 arch and coverage again (symmetric, wardarc stills, no chalk grain on the cards).
- Telegraph: the p5 ring (4.2 m in front of him, bold, no cross); rune cards take a Ticks param.
- Fire: the S30 still's bolt sits 1.2 m out of his thrusting hand on the line to the eye
  (hand from MAGEVR_RIVAL_HAND at 0.620 s of A_Brennic_CastLunge), radius x1.6 for the still;
  -MageArenaS1ReleaseM= and -MageArenaS1BoltScale= override.
- Chalk surface: smooth world-space slate variation, wobbly broken construction guides, chalk
  specks on the sand, UseMeshUv param; dais edges off, the ledge hidden under the backdrop.
- Wardstones stay p7 (a drawn-column still on mesh UVs read darker; T_Q_ChalkPylon kept for later).

D-G4 chalk with Tier B hands, cuff and Brennic in: draws median 106, p95 108; BasePass 167k.
Suite 340 pass, 3 known reds (Fire.Golden, Overlay.Golden, Rivals.NullPath).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
