Subject: [PATCH 088/139] feat(look): chalk cuff in aged hammered bronze,
 glowing runes, HUD as engraved inlay

M_ChalkCuffHud redrawn after the judges read the cuff as "tan cardboard with rainbow
stripes": darker bronze hammered in dents that catch the light, raised lips with green-black
patina in the grooves inside them, a rivet every 20 degrees on both lips, a broken chalk
highlight along the lit top edge; the runes engraved in patina, the lit ones (one per
unlocked tier) glowing in the palette's chalk colours. HP, mana, stamina and clock are now
thin engraved channels with a lit lower lip, filled to their fractions with a muted inlay
(more bronze than hue), so they read as inlay, not stripes. Meaning and fractions unchanged.

