detail did not survive 300-400 px. Under the chalk style:
- a bold silhouette: the screen-width hull Brennic wears (M_BrennicHull at 3 px) led by the
  poseable hands (two draws), and a stronger view-angle contour in Chalk/M_Q_Hands;
