From fa57aedfc47790371ed1282addefb7f0d3a4f0ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:10:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 090/139] feat(art): a wider, harder casting lunge for Brennic
 at 40 px

A_Brennic_CastLunge exaggerated so it reads at 16 m: the stance 34 degrees wide with the hips
lower, the torso leaning harder into the throw with the head kept up, the right arm thrust at
the player and a little out so it clears the body (its fire marks it), the off-hand thrown
back behind him, open. The clip importer now deletes the old clip before importing: an
import over it kept that asset's old scale and folded him into his feet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
