From b1eefb1d98d331d4f26c6dea8c7fbb9f09276938 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:59:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 092/139] feat(art): S30's pointing hand with the sigil on the
 fingertip, pencil outline on the hands

- PlayerHandsLook::ApplyPointingPose (the S30 shot only, never play): the right hand's index
  straight along the hand, the middle, ring and little fingers curled into the palm (75, 95
  and 55 degrees at their joints), the thumb laid along them; knuckles, wrist and segment
  lengths kept, the curl side read from the frame. The shot's sigil already follows
  index_03_r, so its rings now sit on the fingertip; the shot logs MAGEVR_S1 fingertip.
- Pencil, not ink: the hands' screen-width outline is thinner (1.6 px) in a dark warm grey and
  broken, the chalk hands material's contour is lighter, and fine pencil hatching now carries
  the shade alongside the four zones, over the warm two-tone skin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
