From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:59:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 093/139] feat(look): chalk cuff reads as metal, specular
 streak, bright rivets, glowing runes

M_ChalkCuffHud: a lighter bronze, a bright vertical specular streak (and a fainter twin) that
stays where the view puts it, the drawn-metal cue the judges asked for; brighter rivet heads;
the lit runes glow harder (emissive x2.3 with a wider halo) so they read at game scale. The
engraved HUD channels and their meaning are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
