From 51ff59b2a806703c5bb22465df335541ee5fa175 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:25:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 095/139] feat(look): chalk cuff as lit bronze metal, emissive
 runes and engraved HUD

The drawn cuff read as weave or cardboard to every judge. M_ChalkCuffHud is now a cheap lit
material (default lit, fine on the mobile forward path): smooth bronze base colour with a
darker underside, raised lips, green-black patina grooves and rivets, metallic 0.6 and
roughness 0.4 so the sun and sky light give it a moving highlight; the lit runes, the
engraved HUD inlay (HP, mana, stamina, clock, same fractions) and the crack seam glow as
emissive. The hammered dent and grain pattern is gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
