From d3ce32e844b971587e7c5dfeb0a8e3033c584ddd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:25:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 096/139] feat(art): chalk hands in pencil and pastel, no ink
 outline

Judges read the hands as "comic cel style with thick ink outlines". The screen-width hull is
dropped from the hands (two draws fewer), the chalk hands material's contour is a light
0.18, the skin's two tones blend softly (rubbed pastel, no cel step) and fine pencil
hatching carries more of the shade. The pointing pose is unchanged.

