From 7e43f8c22d22e76879cf6cea618cb1983c20f4eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:09:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 099/139] feat(look): 2.5D spike S1, the static scene as a
 painting projected from the seat eye

Behind -MageArena25D=1 under chalk; the p11 look stays the default (its frame is unchanged).
- Export (-MageArenaS1Shot ... -MageArena25DExport): a SceneCapture2D at the seated S30 eye of the
  static scene only (presentation, pawn and mark cards hidden): LDR beauty PNG, scene depth as raw
  float32, 25d-camera.json. -MageArena25DFov/Width/Height; E1 uses one 90-degree 2048x2048 front face
  (pitch -20, the S30 aim).
- Painting: tools/look/gen_25d_scene.py, Flux 2 dev fp8 on the local ComfyUI, gravitone's flux2.ts
  graph plus VAEEncode + SplitSigmasDenoise img2img of the beauty, three text-free S30 crops as late
  ReferenceLatents (0.25). Kept: denoise 0.45 (0.6 moved the sand line and put a knight on the seat).
- prep_25d.py: depth log-encoded into 16-bit (10 cm..1 km), the painting, the camera.
- M_Q_ChalkSurface and M_Q_Sky take a static switch Use25D (off in every shipped instance): the
  projection by the capture camera, gated by frustum, facing and the captured depth, falling back to
  the p11 drawing; an inverse filmic fit and PaintGamma 0.8 return the display-referred painting to
  scene values. *25D instances for sand, dais, pads, seat, ledge and the sky; QuestLook::Surface and
  SkyMaterial pick them under the flag.
- -MageArenaS1EyeOffset=X,Y,Z moves the shot's eye in the camera frame (stereo and lean checks).

Cost (D-G4 stress, ES3.1 proxy, 1920x1080): draws 83 vs 83, GPU median 4.44 vs 4.55 ms (noise);
textures: painting 2048x2048 DXT1 with mips ~2.7 MB, depth 2048x2048 R16F no mips 8 MB.
Suite 346/349 (Fire.Golden, Overlay.Golden, Rivals.NullPath).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
