Subject: [PATCH 100/139] feat(look): Brennic as a painted flipbook card and
 fire flipbook under -MageArena25D

2.5D spike S2, chalk only, behind -MageArena25D=1 (the flag Tier A's S1 uses;
RivalSprite::Enabled parses it on its own until their QuestLook::Is25D lands).
RivalFigure keeps the 3D rig loaded but hidden and draws one upright card that
turns (yaw only) to the seat point, at his kernel feet and presence scale,
showing the cell RivalClips picks (Idle loops, Cast and Hit span the kernel's
