From bf49e627ce214c8070d64b525bcf2d5e514093c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:27:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 102/139] feat(look): 2.5D E2, ControlNet-painted panorama from
 the seat, sprite and flipbook integrated

Behind -MageArena25D=1 under chalk; the p11 look stays the default.
- Painting: the depth/edge FLUX.2 Fun ControlNet Union (2602) through the JLC Flux2 ControlNet nodes
  (v1.1.0, 3de82c9), text-to-image under depth 0.75 (to 65% of steps) and edges 0.4 (to 50%) from
  the engine's own maps (tools/look/control_25d.py). Multi-reference with the depth/edge maps as
  ReferenceLatents (no ControlNet) gave a flat slate frame. Four seeds per face, picked: front
  1536 s44, left 1024 s54, right 1024 s63 (110-degree faces at yaw 0 / -90 / +90).
- tools/look/stitch_25d.py stitches the faces into one 6144x2048 horizon-aligned panorama about
  the seat eye (yaw -145..+145, pitch +35..-75), feathered over each face's outer 12%, the
  orange sand muted toward S30's ochre, pre-darkened for the shader's inverse curve; depth at a
  quarter (1536x512, min-filtered). prep_25d.py is gone.
- The projection samples the panorama by direction from the eye (yaw, pitch) instead of one
  pinhole face; PaintSat 0.9.
- -MageArena25DYaw= turns the export face; -MageArenaS1EyeMm= (Tier B's stereo spelling) maps
  onto -MageArenaS1EyeOffset.
- Tier B's S2 sprite and fire flipbook (cherry-picked) read the shared flag (QuestLook::Is25D);
  a flipbook bolt hides the old pale core card.
- The p11 footprints fade out where they would alias (fwidth of the cell grid).

D-G4 ES3.1 proxy (S1 commit): draws and GPU unchanged by the projection.
Suite 347/350 (Fire.Golden, Overlay.Golden, Rivals.NullPath).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
