rest and the sleeves keep the hero-7 drawn albedo
(T_PlayerHandsChalkDrawn_BaseColor.png). M_Q_Hands gets live pencil hatching
on the shade side again (one number in Tier A's builder call: HatchFreq 220).
Re-run -run=CreatePlayerHands and create-quest-look-assets -Style chalk.

