+# T_CuffPainted_BaseColor.png
+
+The cuff's painted band (round 2 of the chalk hero): Flux 2 dev fp8, local ComfyUI, text only (no reference), 1536 x 384,
+seed 61, 20 steps, guidance 4.0. Prompt, settings and graph: mage-art-staging/push-1028/gen/cuff/band-s61.json.
+Cropped to the band (rims kept), resized to 2048 x 512, and its last 140 px cross-faded into its first 140 (and dropped) so it wraps once round
+the cuff without a seam. Tools/CreateCuffStyledCommandlet imports it as /Game/Look/Shared/Cuff/T_CuffPainted_BaseColor and
+M_ChalkCuffHud wraps it by angle and height (UsePaint 1).
+Then brightened (value^0.8 x 1.25: the lit metal darkens it again) and its outer 16 rows top and bottom flattened to their mean
+colour, because the cuff's end caps read the band's edge row at every angle and a detailed row there showed as radial streaks.
