paper tooth, and colour-matches the hero-7 fill to the painted skin where no
view reaches (the light patch on the right forearm). M_Q_Hands hatching is
coarser (HatchFreq 90 in Tier A's builder call) so it reads as strokes.
Re-run CreatePlayerHands and create-quest-look-assets -Style chalk.

