From ba6037c343fdc2764e0515c3c308061a84cff961 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:35:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 115/139] feat(look): S30 shot at 7 m and 4 m keeps the thrown
 bolt in the open

-MageArenaS1RivalM= (capture-s1.ps1 -RivalM 7 / 4, the coverage memo's 3.5-8 m duel range) already
stands Brennic nearer on the seat line in the same cast pose and time; the shot's bolt now sits at
most half way between his thrusting hand and the seat, so at 4 m it is not on his chest. The 16 m
default is unchanged (the bolt stays 3.2 m from the seat).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/vr/Game/Source/MageArenaVR/Look/S1ShotCapture.cpp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

