Subject: [PATCH 127/139] perf(look): chalk sky light from a fixed cubemap, no
 scene recaptures

Under -MageArenaStyle=chalk the sky light takes /Engine/EngineResources/GrayTextureCube
(SLS_SpecifiedCubemap) and the delayed 2 s and 6 s recaptures are skipped. A scene capture
redraws the arena into six cube faces, about 830 draws in one frame; the 6 s one could land
after the bout started (the single 829-draw frame in the s7 D-G4 run, the 920-990-draw outliers
in quest r1-r8). Every chalk surface is unlit; the lit cuff keeps an even ambient and still
reads as lit bronze (checked in a capture). Painted and epic keep the captured sky.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
