Subject: [PATCH 128/139] feat(look): wire Ward, Strafe and Sunfall into the
 rival sprite

RivalSprite::Pick chooses the sprite clip from the rig's event state and
the kernel actor's own state, by priority: Death > Hit > Ward (bAbsorb) >
Roll (the step clip) > the cast by tier (4: Sunfall, else Cast) > Strafe
(moving across the seat's line of sight faster than 0.6 m/s, mirrored card
for a move to the viewer's left) > Idle. The kernel's phase beat has no clip
and shows Idle. RivalClips keeps the cast's tier; the five pages load; Ward
plays its raise and then loops its held cells while absorbing. The
presentation passes the actor's absorb, roll and sideways speed. Test:
SpritePick (every priority, the tier, the mirror by sign, the ward hold).
-MageArenaRivalTrace also logs the sprite pick every 15 ticks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
