Subject: [PATCH 132/139] fix(art): hand fill with pastel variation, hatched
 shade, lighter creases

Judges: a flat cardboard fill, banded finger creases, white patches.
chalk_hands.py (HANDS_R6=1) lays broad pastel patches of rose, ochre and a
cool tan over the skin from the 3D position, hatches the shade side of the
palm and fingers in a deeper warm pastel, and draws the finger creases and
veins lighter and more broken; hands_paint.py no longer lets the painted
form layer brighten past the drawn base. Built on Tier A's s6 hand rim and
cuff (681abaa); only the fill texture changes. Re-run -run=CreatePlayerHands.

