From 2b70731a352c64cb68b0bc721674d19015c4984f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:21:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 133/139] feat(look): cast fire on the painted hand, no seam
 over the card, a breathing idle

S7 judges: the hand fire floated off the painting (anchored to the hidden
rig's hand), a horizontal line across his chest, and Idle read frozen.
- The cell table carries the painted right hand per cell
  (RivalSpriteAnchors.inl, generated by pack_pages.py from hand_anchor.py:
  the skin blob furthest out along the casting direction, visible when it
  is out from his body or raised); the fire sits on the card at that point,
  15 cm toward the seat, only in Cast and Sunfall and only when visible.
- The line was the arena's translucent sand edge behind him sorting after
  the card; the card now sorts after the arena's translucent layers.
- In Idle the card breathes (2 % taller and back about the feet, 3.6 s) and
  shifts its weight 2.5 cm side to side (7.2 s), about 4-5 px at 7 m.

