From f3bb3122b37802ab87b63f41ffa344f053436563 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:21:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 134/139] feat(art): Brennic's Ward, Strafe, Hit and Sunfall
 without the popping cape

The four keys are repainted from the idle key (denoise 0.92, the idle key
as the only reference, a prompt with no cloak at all: a shoulder collar,
nothing hanging), and their H3 segments re-rendered, so the cape no longer
appears mid-clip; Idle, Cast and Death stay. Sunfall's new keys have no
light streaks; Hit's painted blast frames are cut. The pack drops the rig
bound on the matte (it cut the casting hand off at the wrist, the stubby
arm in the shot pose), and Sunfall keeps its source's size (raised hands
fooled the measure into a 29 % jump). Re-run -run=CreateRivalSprite.

