From b070c56b8c7810bca7efa0936520332da25f4ce3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkazm04 <kazdan@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:31:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 137/139] fix(art): hand fill in light chalk on a mid-tone skin

HANDS_R8: a warm mid-tone skin in two rubbed value planes, drawn in light
chalk: extensor tendons from each knuckle toward the wrist, a soft highlight
on each knuckle head and the thumb joint, faint joint creases. No dense
hatching (the lit and deep hatches read as wood grain on the islands, and
the knuckle arcs closed into rings in UV).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../Hands/T_PlayerHandsChalk_BaseColor.uasset |  4 +-
 apps/vr/art/hands/chalk_hands.py              | 56 +++++++++++++++++++
