 pastel robe

Judges (s8): a white sticker halo, a mosaic/halftone crunch at 4 m, the robe
wants pastel shading. pack_pages.py chalk(): the local colour rubbed soft and
lifted toward pale chalk on the lit side; hatching at 16 and 19 px periods at
768 (was 9 and 11), its masks and the shade blurred so it does not alias into a
dot screen at 4 m; softer tooth; the contour 1-3.5 px (was 2-6), broken in about
a third of its length, at half strength.

